 * target (Android release, desktop on every OS, web JS and Wasm, iOS arm64;
 * see `muviss.licensee` in build-logic, the target builds, and docs/RELEASING.md
 * "OSS licenses"). The list is their union (#615). Regenerate with
 * `./gradlew :app:androidApp:regenerateOssLicenses` (#562); `check` runs
 * `verifyOssLicenses`, which fails when a report lists an artifact with no
 * entry here, or an entry here names an artifact no report lists (#616), or
 * an entry's name or licence differs from the reports (#666). This is a
 * checked-in file rather than a live read because the reports are written to
